sequenceDiagram
  actor App as Consumer App
  participant JS as guest-js voice API
  participant Cmd as plugin:voice commands
  participant Voice as TauriPluginVoice
  participant Boot as Shared Bootstrap
  participant STT as STT Engine State
  participant Worker as STT Worker

  App->>JS: bootstrapVoice()
  JS->>Cmd: plugin:voice|bootstrap_voice
  Cmd->>Voice: bootstrap_voice(request)
  Voice->>Boot: ensure shared Python environment
  Boot-->>Voice: bootstrap ready
  Voice->>STT: start or reuse default STT worker
  STT->>Worker: spawn worker.py
  Worker-->>STT: ready
  STT-->>Voice: STT ready
  Voice-->>Cmd: voice bootstrap response
  Cmd-->>JS: response
  JS-->>App: response

  App->>JS: downloadModel({ engine: "stt", modelId })
  JS->>Cmd: plugin:voice|download_model
  Cmd->>Voice: download_model(request)
  Voice->>STT: validate model and replace worker
  STT->>Worker: spawn with requested model
  Worker-->>STT: progress lines
  STT-->>App: model progress event with engine="stt"
  Worker-->>STT: ready
  STT-->>Voice: model active
  Voice-->>Cmd: download response with engine="stt"
  Cmd-->>JS: response
  JS-->>App: response
